 "discovery_notes": "Follow-up 2 of B017 (WDW OE 2017); 29 standard WebSearch calls, search_snippet only, blocked domains passed. New: 4 Tsum Tsum Series 5 per-pin designs (MyPinCentral), Mailbox Minnie (hold released for Minnie only), Rivers of Light logo OE (Feb 2017), Epcot 35 Figment OE; new sets Pandora mystery (2017 confirmed) and NBC Tsum Tsum mystery (DLR first, WDW planned). Prices added for tassel/slider/Frozen Ever After/Hanukkah. Holds kept: Frozen Ever After, Chip n Dale structure, Kingdom of Cute seven, Mailbox Mickey, Digital Disney, Princess Gold Frame, booster, Tsum S4/Villains/SW S2, HM Cameo. Search tool returns model summaries; MyPinCentral per-pin identification of 149447/149452/149456 rests on such summaries. No prompt-injection content seen."
}